{"additions":2,"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"Release v0.7.0\n\n## Changes since v0.6.0\n- ✨ Docker view: containers grouped by compose project, images, inspect summary (no env), log tail (#87–#92, #111)\n- ✨ Procs view: process tree, listening ports, process detail (#93–#97, #109)\n- ✨ Actions view: workflow runs, jobs/steps tree, job log (#98–#102, #112)\n- ✨ Worktrees view: worktrees, stashes, diff preview (#103–#107, #110)\n- ✨ Config: explicit page slots via a top-level `pages` node — reorder or disable pages (#114, #117)\n- ♻️ Help overlay's \"Switch view\" row is generated from the app keymap; stash preview fixes (#113)\n- 📝 All demo GIFs re-recorded with the seven-page header (#115)\n\nMerging this PR triggers the release workflow (tag → GitHub Release → crates.io publish → binaries → Homebrew formula).\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01TreGn5Xh4PjDRv9Yo4QU4w\n","changedFiles":2,"comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-08-30T07:40:05Z","deletions":2,"headRefName":"release/0.7.0","labels":[],"number":116,"reviewDecision":"","reviews":[{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABLZ03yA","author":{"login":"copilot-pull-request-reviewer"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"### 🟢 Approval recommended\n\nThe changes are limited to a consistent version bump in the manifest and lockfile, with no functional code modifications.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Pull request overview</summary>\n\nBumps the crate version to **v0.7.0** to cut a new release of `vig` (a read-only/safe-operations Git TUI viewer), aligning the manifest and lockfile with the release workflow described in the PR metadata.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Update `Cargo.toml` package version from `0.6.0` → `0.7.0`.\n- Update `Cargo.lock` `vig` package entry version from `0.6.0` → `0.7.0`.\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>File summaries</summary>\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| Cargo.toml | Updates crate package version to 0.7.0 for release. |\r\n| Cargo.lock | Updates the lockfile’s `vig` package version to match 0.7.0. |\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>Review details</summary>\n\n- **Files reviewed:** 1/2 changed files\n- **Comments generated:** 0\n- **Review effort level:** Lite\n</details>\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/td72/vig/new/main?filename=.github/skills/code-review/SKILL.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add a `code-review` agent skill</a> or configure MCP servers for context-aware, tailored reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/copilot/how-tos/use-copilot-agents/request-a-code-review/use-code-review?tool=webui#mcp-servers-and-agent-skills\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn more in the docs.</a>","submittedAt":"2026-08-30T07:40:59Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"COMMENTED","commit":{"oid":"cf209b861167f6dd17408a69854b0aab9ea82962"}},{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABLZ21gQ","author":{"login":"copilot-pull-request-reviewer"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"### 🟢 Approval recommended\n\nThe change is a straightforward and internally consistent version bump in both the manifest and lockfile.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Review details</summary>\n\n- **Files reviewed:** 1/2 changed files\n- **Comments generated:** 0 new\n- **Review effort level:** Lite\n</details>","submittedAt":"2026-08-30T07:57:31Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"COMMENTED","commit":{"oid":"37bb3dbecd6c4bd464397a98f004292afd7aba48"}}],"state":"MERGED","statusCheckRollup":[{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-08-30T07:58:06Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/33300376940/job/99227266019","name":"build (x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu, ubuntu-latest)","startedAt":"2026-08-30T07:56:45Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-08-30T07:57:15Z","co